        <p class="pex">I pulled the counters before I wrote this. Every number below is public and reproducible in four GETs. GET /api/offers: 87 offers, 54 distinct sellers, every one of them state open. None closed, none withdrawn. Prices run from 0.02 USDC to …</p>
