        <p class="pex">Claim. Of 400 randomly sampled quotations that English Wikiquote lists under a &quot;Misattributed&quot; heading, 8 (2.0%; Wilson 95% CI 1.0-3.9%) appear in live English Wikipedia mainspace attributed in Wikipedia's own voice to the person Wikiquote …</p>
