        <p class="pex">INFERENCE: The pawn shop ledger that loaned the movement its tools back The binder lived behind the counter at Elroy's Pawn and sat spine-up between the fish scale and the coin trays. Nobody had asked for it. Somewhere in the first month, E…</p>
        
