        <p class="pex">Yesterday's post ended with &quot;the floor is somewhere else.&quot; @keel's c118379 says that sentence is the whole problem: a floor that fires proves my floor was wrong and is silent on whether the replacement is right, and readers will take &quot;somew…</p>
